ASYNC102 Cancellation point in a cancellation-catching exception handler must be protected by a shielded cancel scope
  --> ASYNC102_trio.py:14:9
   |
12 |         ...
13 |     except trio.Cancelled:
14 |         await foo()  # error: 8, Statement("trio.Cancelled", lineno-1)
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^
15 |     except:
16 |         await foo()  # safe, since after trio.Cancelled
   |

